qtclient (CIP-compatible Qt/QML client)
======================================

Not affiliated with CipSoft GmbH. This project is an independent,
parity-oriented implementation of a CipSoft-compatible client and launcher.
It is **not** an official Tibia product. "Tibia" and related marks are
trademarks of CipSoft GmbH; use of those names here is descriptive only.

This is not a clean-room rewrite: source comments and behavior aim at CIP
parity. Reverse-engineering tooling is not redistributed in the public tree.

